  "hindi": "मैं तुम्हारे लिए उत्तम रूप से दीप्तिमान, सुन्दर स्तुतियों वाले, जनों के अतिथि, उत्तम अन्न वाले अग्नि को पुकारता हूँ; जो मित्र के समान प्राप्त करने योग्य होकर देवभक्त जन में देव बना है, उस जातवेदस् को।",
  "english": "I call for you on Agni, brightly shining, of fair praise, the guest of the clans, rich in good food, who like a friend has become one to be gained, a god among the god-devoted people, Jātavedas.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "didhiṣāyya is uncertain (taken as 'to be gained, to be upheld'); ā-deva is taken as 'godly, devoted to the gods'; vaḥ could be read as accusative ('you') or as dative/genitive ('for you'); mitra iva could also be 'like Mitra'. Jātavedas is an epithet of Agni.",
  "confidence": "low"
 },
